    "body": "**Branch**: `main`\n**Repo**: `matthewmcneill/bug-fixer-loop-plugin`\n\nRename all tags/labels used by the bug-fixer system so they are prefixed with `bug-fixer:`. This makes it easy to identify which tags belong to the bug-fixer system vs other tooling.\n\nFor example:\n- `error` \u2192 `bug-fixer:error`\n- `fix-applied` \u2192 `bug-fixer:fix-applied`\n\n**Steps:**\n1. Audit all tags currently used by the bug-fixer system\n2. Rename each tag to include the `bug-fixer:` prefix\n3. Update all code references to use the new tag names\n\n---\n_Captured via todo skill_",
